<title>UK: Glaxo firms on ABN AMRO's upbeat comments.</title>
<headline>Glaxo firms on ABN AMRO's upbeat comments.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Glaxo Wellcome rose 19-1/2p to 996p by 0910 GMT on Monday after brokerage ABN AMRO Hoare Govett made positive comments about the stock, dealers said.  </p>
<p>The brokerage is said to be preparing to upgrade the stock and profit forecasts in short order, dealers said.</p>
<p>The analyst couldn't immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
